age.status}"><span aria-hidden="true"></span><div><b>${esc(stage.name)}</b><p>${esc(stage.detail)}</p></div><small>${esc(stageMeta(stage))}</small></li>`).join("")}</ol></details></div></details><footer>${source.canRefresh?`<button type="button" class="primary" data-diagnostics-action="refresh" data-source-id="${esc(source.id)}" ${ctx.canRefresh&&!ctx.canRefresh()?"disabled":""}>${hasFailure?"Retry update":"Update"}</button>`:""}${source.type==="API"?`<button type="button" data-diagnostics-action="authentication" data-source-id="${esc(source.id)}" ${ctx.canEdit&&!ctx.canEdit()?"disabled":""}>${authNeedsAttention?"Sign in again":"Authentication"}</button>`:""}<button type="button" data-diagnostics-action="types" data-source-id="${esc(source.id)}" ${ctx.canEdit&&!ctx.canEdit()?"disabled":""}>Column types</button><button type="button" data-diagnostics-action="edit" data-source-id="${esc(source.id)}" ${ctx.canEdit&&!ctx.canEdit()?"disabled":""}>Edit source</button></footer></article>`;};
